  "id": "retrieval",
  "term": "retrieval",
  "definition": "In cognition, retrieval here refers to lexical retrieval: accessing and producing words from the mental lexicon, such as when naming items in a category. It is often examined with verbal fluency tasks and can be impaired in aphasia.",
